    "details": {
      "Body": "Bumps [actions/setup-python](https://github.com/actions/setup-python) from 6.3.0 to 7.1.0.\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a href=\"https://github.com/actions/setup-python/releases\">actions/setup-python's releases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>v7.1.0</h2>\n<h2>What's Changed</h2>\n<h3>Enhancements</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Add <code>mirror</code> and <code>mirror-token</code> inputs for custom Python distribution sources by <a href=\"https://github.com/luhenry\"><code>@luhenry</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/setup-python/pull/1302\">actions/setup-python#1302</a></li>\n<li>Improve error message clarity by <a href=\"https://github.com/v-lmvysakh\"><code>@v-lmvysakh</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/setup-python/pull/1351\">actions/setup-python#1351</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Dependency Upgrade</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Upgrade browserslist from 4.28.2 to 4.28.9 by <a href=\"https://github.com/dependabot\"><code>@dependabot</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/setup-python/pull/1353\">actions/setup-python#1353</a></li>\n<li>Upgrade <code>@typescript-eslint/parser</code> from 8.62.0 to 8.70.0 by <a href=\"https://github.com/dependabot\"><code>@dependabot</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/setup-python/pull/1343\">actions/setup-python#1343</a></li>\n<li>Upgrade eslint-plugin-jest from 29.15.2 to 29.16.6 by <a href=\"https://github.com/dependabot\"><code>@dependabot</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/setup-python/pull/1342\">actions/setup-python#1342</a></li>\n<li>Upgrade <code>@vercel/ncc</code> from 0.44.0 to 0.45.0 by <a href=\"https://github.com/dependabot\"><code>@dependabot</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/setup-python/pull/1357\">actions/setup-python#1357</a></li>\n<li>Upgrade <code>@types/semver</code> from 7.7.1 to 7.8.0 by <a href=\"https://github.com/dependabot\"><code>@dependabot</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/setup-python/pull/1359\">actions/setup-python#1359</a></li>\n<li>Upgrade undici from 6.28.0 to 6.29.0 by <a href=\"https://github.com/dependabot\"><code>@dependabot</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/setup-python/pull/1364\">actions/setup-python#1364</a></li>\n<li>Upgrade ts-jest from 29.4.11 to 29.4.14 by <a href=\"https://github.com/dependabot\"><code>@dependabot</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/setup-python/pull/1361\">actions/setup-python#1361</a></li>\n<li>Upgrade brace-expansion from 5.0.9 to 5.0.12 by <a href=\"https://github.com/dependabot\"><code>@dependabot</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/setup-python/pull/1365\">actions/setup-python#1365</a></li>\n<li>Upgrade prettier from 3.8.4 to 3.9.9 and package.json from 7.0.0 to 7.1.0 by <a href=\"https://github.com/dependabot\"><code>@dependabot</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/setup-python/pull/1363\">actions/setup-python#1363</a></li>\n<li>Upgrade <code>@typescript-eslint/eslint-plugin</code> from 8.62.0 to 8.71.1 by <a href=\"https://github.com/dependabot\"><code>@dependabot</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/setup-python/pull/1369\">actions/setup-python#1369</a></li>\n<li>Upgrade actions/checkout from 7.0.0 to 7.0.1 by <a href=\"https://github.com/dependabot\"><code>@dependabot</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/setup-python/pull/1345\">actions/setup-python#1345</a></li>\n<li>Upgrade cache to 6.3.0 by <a href=\"https://github.com/v-HarithaVattikuti\"><code>@v-HarithaVattikuti</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/setup-python/pull/1370\">actions/setup-python#1370</a></li>\n<li>Resolve Basic Validation audit failures by <a href=\"https://github.com/v-HarithaVattikuti\"><code>@v-HarithaVattikuti</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/setup-python/pull/1347\">actions/setup-python#1347</a></li>\n<li>Resolve npm audit failures by <a href=\"https://github.com/v-HarithaVattikuti\"><code>@v-HarithaVattikuti</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/setup-python/pull/1350\">actions/setup-python#1350</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>New Contributors</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/luhenry\"><code>@luhenry</code></a> made their first contribution in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/setup-python/pull/1302\">actions/setup-python#1302</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Full Changelog</strong>: <a href=\"https://github.com/actions/setup-python/compare/v7.0.0...v7.1.0\">https://github.com/actions/setup-python/compare/v7.0.0...v7.1.0</a></p>\n<h2>v7.0.0</h2>\n<h2>What's Changed</h2>\n<h3>Enhancements</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Migrate to ESM and upgrade dependencies by <a href=\"https://github.com/priyagupta108\"><code>@priyagupta108</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/setup-python/pull/1330\">actions/setup-python#1330</a></li>\n<li>Pin SHA commits and update docs with latest versions by <a href=\"https://github.com/HarithaVattikuti\"><code>@HarithaVattikuti</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/setup-python/pull/1338\">actions/setup-python#1338</a></li>\n<li>Remove the pip-install input by <a href=\"https://github.com/gowridurgad\"><code>@gowridurgad</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/setup-python/pull/1336\">actions/setup-python#1336</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Bug Fix</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Fix to Classify stderr warning messages as warnings instead of errors in annotations by <a href=\"https://github.com/lmvysakh\"><code>@lmvysakh</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/setup-python/pull/1335\">actions/setup-python#1335</a></li>\n<li>Validate and retry manifest fetch to prevent silent failures by <a href=\"https://github.com/priyagupta108\"><code>@priyagupta108</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/setup-python/pull/1332\">actions/setup-python#1332</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Dependency Upgrade</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Bump certifi from 2020.6.20 to 2024.7.4 in /<strong>tests</strong>/data by <a href=\"https://github.com/dependabot\"><code>@dependabot</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/setup-python/pull/1328\">actions/setup-python#1328</a></li>\n<li>Remove EOL Python versions and Bumps numpy text fixture by <a href=\"https://github.com/priya-kinthali\"><code>@priya-kinthali</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/setup-python/pull/1333\">actions/setup-python#1333</a></li>\n<li>Upgrade <code>@actions/cache</code> to 6.2.0 by <a href=\"https://github.com/philip-gai\"><code>@philip-gai</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/setup-python/pull/1337\">actions/setup-python#1337</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>New Contributors</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/lmvysakh\"><code>@lmvysakh</code></a> made their first contribution in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/setup-python/pull/1335\">actions/setup-python#1335</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/philip-gai\"><code>@philip-gai</code></a> made their first contribution in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/setup-python/pull/1337\">actions/setup-python#1337</a></li>\n</ul>\n<!-- raw HTML omitted -->\n</blockquote>\n<p>... (truncated)</p>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/actions/setup-python/commit/6d4fd22b20465ccc0f7354476588e8df7c9ca0e0\"><code>6d4fd22</code></a> Cache upgrade to 6.3.0 (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/setup-python/issues/1370\">#1370</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/actions/setup-python/commit/ec52d0af729a7c50ced4261d17a07916f43f5b8e\"><code>ec52d0a</code></a> Bump <code>@typescript-eslint/eslint-plugin</code> from 8.62.0 to 8.71.1 (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/setup-python/issues/1369\">#1369</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/actions/setup-python/commit/ff73b2463e2f3baa703f830da214b8dfeeaeccf8\"><code>ff73b24</code></a> Bump prettier from 3.8.4 to 3.9.9 and package.json from 7.0.0 to 7.1.0 (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/setup-python/issues/1363\">#1363</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/actions/setup-python/commit/0e40890053525508c059c61932a6b8614f9e95db\"><code>0e40890</code></a> Bump brace-expansion from 5.0.9 to 5.0.12 (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/setup-python/issues/1365\">#1365</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/actions/setup-python/commit/3892123fbe74688ccc83ec7c465dc688359e5199\"><code>3892123</code></a> Bump ts-jest from 29.4.11 to 29.4.14 (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/setup-python/issues/1361\">#1361</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/actions/setup-python/commit/660965736c4aecc62797ea07d351a3c259f14660\"><code>6609657</code></a> Bump undici from 6.28.0 to 6.29.0 (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/setup-python/issues/1364\">#1364</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/actions/setup-python/commit/e1be392b26fb1917a7b2c455817e4b4dad6544ce\"><code>e1be392</code></a> Bump <code>@types/semver</code> from 7.7.1 to 7.8.0 (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/setup-python/issues/1359\">#1359</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/actions/setup-python/commit/06da6279cdbca41027908073e81a4544dc79c06b\"><code>06da627</code></a> Bump <code>@vercel/ncc</code> from 0.44.0 to 0.45.0 (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/setup-python/issues/1357\">#1357</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/actions/setup-python/commit/af9bcc7548695e66d75709de6f29e337624b8de8\"><code>af9bcc7</code></a> Bump eslint-plugin-jest from 29.15.2 to 29.16.6 (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/setup-python/issues/1342\">#1342</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/actions/setup-python/commit/7aeabeba5501120d873c50398519dbfd0657031c\"><code>7aeabeb</code></a> Bump <code>@typescript-eslint/parser</code> from 8.62.0 to 8.70.0 (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/setup-python/issues/1343\">#1343</a>)</li>\n<li>Additional commits viewable in <a href=\"https://github.com/actions/setup-python/compare/ece7cb06caefa5fff74198d8649806c4678c61a1...6d4fd22b20465ccc0f7354476588e8df7c9ca0e0\">compare view</a></li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<br />\n",
      "Diff": "diff --git a/.github/workflows/check.yml b/.github/workflows/check.yml\nindex afbfbcae..f6ae2c21 100644\n--- a/.github/workflows/check.yml\n+++ b/.github/workflows/check.yml\n@@ -52,7 +52,7 @@ jobs:\n           persist-credentials: false\n \n       - name: Set up Python\n-        uses: actions/setup-python@ece7cb06caefa5fff74198d8649806c4678c61a1 # v6\n+        uses: actions/setup-python@6d4fd22b20465ccc0f7354476588e8df7c9ca0e0 # v7.1.0\n         with:\n           python-version: ${{ matrix.python-version }}\n           # The tool pins live in pyproject.toml, so it is the cache key.\n@@ -109,7 +109,7 @@ jobs:\n       # (see `[tool.ruff.per-file-target-version]` in pyproject.toml), so its\n       # portable lane has to import and pass there, not only on 3.14+.\n       - name: Set up Python\n-        uses: actions/setup-python@ece7cb06caefa5fff74198d8649806c4678c61a1 # v6\n+        uses: actions/setup-python@6d4fd22b20465ccc0f7354476588e8df7c9ca0e0 # v7.1.0\n         with:\n           python-version: \"3.13\"\n \n@@ -137,7 +137,7 @@ jobs:\n           persist-credentials: false\n \n       - name: Set up Python\n-        uses: actions/setup-python@ece7cb06caefa5fff74198d8649806c4678c61a1 # v6\n+        uses: actions/setup-python@6d4fd22b20465ccc0f7354476588e8df7c9ca0e0 # v7.1.0\n         with:\n           python-version: \"3.14\"\n           # The tool pins live in pyproject.toml, so it is the cache key. Only\ndiff --git a/.github/workflows/harness-compatibility.yml b/.github/workflows/harness-compatibility.yml\nindex e617c2db..ca734c91 100644\n--- a/.github/workflows/harness-compatibility.yml\n+++ b/.github/workflows/harness-compatibility.yml\n@@ -88,7 +88,7 @@ jobs:\n           persist-credentials: false\n \n       - name: Set up Python\n-        uses: actions/setup-python@ece7cb06caefa5fff74198d8649806c4678c61a1 # v6\n+        uses: actions/setup-python@6d4fd22b20465ccc0f7354476588e8df7c9ca0e0 # v7.1.0\n         with:\n           python-version: \"3.14